<title>USA: Nature's to buy back up to 500,000 shares.</title>
<headline>Nature's to buy back up to 500,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>PROVO, Utah 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nature's Sunshine Products Inc on Thursday said it plans to buy back up to 500,000 shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>&quot;We believe our stock is an attractive investment, and we want to be in a position to purchase more stock as market conditions warrant,&quot; said Kristine Hughes, company chairman and chief executive.</p>
<p>The stock will be purchased in the open market and will be used for general purposes, the company said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
